model tropek_r7
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-17
  start 2024-01-01
  end 2056-11-30
  note "T, M2 (issues #167, #114), DONE gate 2: R7 (to2028.tally's texts) to 2056-11-30, for konto and net worth on 2056-10-17 (pins-1-7.json: 22 613.79, 10 093 811.25; moved by L-26) and G10 (net worth in 2056 at 5 % inflation, infl5.tally, about 5 980k nominal; in today's money, divided by index.prices of 2056, about 4 159k and 1 384k). Not stored: refcore and refcore_fast pass the 8 GB cap on this horizon (stopped at 8.4 and 8.7 GB after 55 and 57 s), as every 15th's projection walks to the end (P2, GOLDENS.md)."

index cal_year = year 2024..2056

index day = day 2026-10-17..2056-11-30

index month = month 2024-01..2056-11

ask g10_net_worth: net_worth[2056-10-17], round(net_worth[2056-10-17] / price_index[2056], minor(PLN), half-up)

ask g10_net_worth_infl5: net_worth[2056-10-17], round(net_worth[2056-10-17] / price_index[2056], minor(PLN), half-up) in infl5

ask pin_2056: bal(konto, 2056-10-17), net_worth[2056-10-17]
